{"updated":"2026-10-15T06:01:29.458Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: France 'can no longer finance' Ukraine, far-right presidential frontrunner Le Pen says. Elsewhere, australian politics live: Shoebridge denies knowing about Steele-John allegations and says he’s entitled to fair process. And is Lamine Yamal’s Barcelona record better than Messi’s as a teenager?. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Ukraine, and Russia are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 1.3 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 1.5 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 1.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 33 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.9 near Fiji region. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.13,0.17,0.22,0.26,0.3,0.35,0.4,0.43,0.46,0.51,0.55,0.58,0.61,0.64,0.69,0.8,0.89,1.04,1.32,1.44,1.49,1.51,1.53,1.57,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.68,1.73,1.8,1.86,1.9,1.94,1.99,2.03,2.07,2.1,2.16,2.21,2.25,2.3,2.35,2.39,2.44,2.48,2.53,2.58,2.63,2.71,2.82,2.91,3.06,3.09,3.13,3.16,3.22,3.26,3.32,3.44,3.52,3.58,3.65,3.68,3.73,3.77,3.81,3.85,3.88,3.9,3.95,3.97,3.99,4.02,4.06,4.1,4.18,4.24,4.32,4.4,4.47,4.59,4.63,4.69,4.71,4.77,4.87,5.02,5.19,5.63,5.7,5.79,5.88,5.93,5.99,6.14,6.17,6.24,6.3,6.35,6.4,6.47,6.51,6.58,6.66,6.7,6.76,6.8,6.86,6.91,6.93,7,7.07,7.19,7.27,7.34,7.4,7.44,7.49,7.52,7.57,7.69,7.75,7.83,7.92,7.96,8,8.15,8.21,8.42,8.49,8.58,8.63,8.68,8.74,8.79,8.84,8.87,8.92,8.97,9.02,9.07,9.11,9.16,9.22,9.26,9.31,9.35,9.39,9.44,9.48,9.53,9.59,9.64,9.68,9.72,9.78,9.83,9.89,9.94,9.97,10.02,10.06,10.1,10.19,10.27,10.31,10.37,10.41,10.54,10.61,10.7,10.76,10.88,10.95,11.07,11.25,11.69,11.81,11.87,11.92,11.97,12,12.06,12.1,12.15,12.22,12.27,12.31,12.36,12.4,12.45,12.5,12.56,12.62,12.68,12.74,12.78,12.82,12.88,12.92,12.98,